WEBVTT

00:11:28.268 --> 00:11:30.252
JO: If the kids don't know what stuff is,

00:11:30.276 --> 00:11:31.675
then they will never eat it.

00:11:33.863 --> 00:11:35.120
(Laughter)

00:11:35.144 --> 00:11:37.916
JO: Normal. England and America,

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.478
England and America.

00:11:39.502 --> 00:11:41.645
Guess what fixed that.

00:11:42.107 --> 00:11:43.580
Two one-hour sessions.

00:11:45.151 --> 00:11:48.540
We've got to start teaching our kids
about food in schools, period.

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:54.916
(Applause)

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:58.961
I want to tell you about something

00:11:58.985 --> 00:12:03.323
that kind of epitomizes the trouble
that we're in, guys, OK?